# Code owners for BaseMM_PRISM.
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owning entry whenever a matching file
# changes. Branch protection on `main` will require one approving review at the
# public release (it runs with `required_approving_review_count: 0` while the
# release gates land); without this file that review can come from any account
# with write access, with no routing to anyone who knows the area.
#
# @AI-ModCon/base-multimodal is the only team with access to this repository
# (permission: maintain). Entries naming a team without repo access are
# silently ignored by GitHub, so keep this list in sync with that grant.
#
# Note: `require_code_owner_reviews` is NOT enabled on `main` today, so these
# entries request reviews rather than block merges. Turn that setting on once
# the maintainer roster is settled.

# Default owner for everything not matched by a more specific rule.
*                           @AI-ModCon/base-multimodal

# Release governance and CI: changes here decide what can merge at all.
/.github/                   @AI-ModCon/base-multimodal
/tools/ci/                  @AI-ModCon/base-multimodal
/requirements/              @AI-ModCon/base-multimodal

# Licensing and public-release surface.
/LICENSE                    @AI-ModCon/base-multimodal
/NOTICE                     @AI-ModCon/base-multimodal
